Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3-textual (>= 0.80), python3-dbus, python3-websockets
Description: Terminal music player with synchronized lyrics
 player-tui is a terminal music player with synchronized lyrics
 display, compatible with any MPRIS2-compatible media player
 (Spotify, Firefox, ncspot, VLC, mpv, etc.).
 .
 Features:
  - Real-time synced lyrics from LRCLIB
  - 16 accent colors + 17 border colors (including white)
  - True transparency support
  - Persistent color preferences
  - Vim-like keybindings (Ant, Sig, Quit, Text, Edge)
